{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0156fFWbSdYS5T4Zt4FHJbTZ","type":"tool_result","content":"# ard configuration for albertcbrown/ard (dogfooding). Started from `ard init`'s\n# template; human-owned. ard serve reads it from origin/main.\n# Anything unset takes its built-in default (docs/proposal.md, Configuration).\n# Validate with `ard config check`. ard serve reads this file from origin/main.\n\n# label: only issues a maintainer labels for triage enter the pipeline.\n# all: every human-filed issue enters.\nintake: { mode: label }\n\n# Loop poll intervals. Unset loops keep their defaults (scanners 4h,\n# prwatch 5m); 1m is the minimum. Triage, workers, reviewers and the merger\n# poll every minute so an approval, a finished job or a freed slot is picked\n# up within a minute instead of up to 15. The cost is GitHub API reads, not\n# job slots. Stopgap until approval and close-out wake the next loop directly.\nintervals: { triage: 1m, workers: 1m, reviewers: 1m, merger: 1m }\n\nmerge:\n  # A PR touching any of these waits for a human approval. There is no\n  # built-in list: removing an entry removes its gate. An entry ending in /\n  # is a directory prefix; anything else is a glob (quote globs starting with *).\n  protected_paths:\n    - .github/\n    - .ard/config.yaml\n    - .ard/scanners/\n    - .ard/triage/\n    - .ard/workers/\n    - .ard/reviewers/\n    - \"**/CODEOWNERS\"\n    # Agent instructions a PR could plant to steer later agents.\n    - CLAUDE.md\n    - \"**/CLAUDE.md\"\n    - AGENTS.md\n    - \"**/AGENTS.md\"\n    - .claude/\n    - .mcp.json\n    # What builds, signs and deploys ard itself (docs/proposal.md, Delivery).\n    - \"Jenkinsfile*\"\n    - Dockerfile\n    - .dockerignore\n    - deploy/\n\noverrides:\n  scanners/cve: { every: 6h, max_open: 10, group_size: 1, autoclose: true }\n  # Phase 1 agent roles (the ard init starter set, #39 Gate 2).\n  triage/lead:  { model: claude-opus-5-5, timeout: 15m }\n  triage/engineer: { model: claude-sonnet-5-5 }\n  workers/engineer: { model: claude-sonnet-5-5, timeout: 60m, tests: make lint test }\n  reviewers/eng-review: { model: claude-sonnet-5-5 }\ninternal:\nagent\nagentjob\nbotcheck\nbudget\ncli\ncloseout\ncommitter\nconfig\nconfigcmd\nconfigsrc\ncontroller\ncostblock\ncosts\ndigest\ndocscheck\neffects\nexecutor\ngithub\ngitref\ngitx\nimagescan\ninitcmd\nintake\njanitor\njobexec\njobpod\njobpost\njobpre\nlabels\nlimits\nmerger\nmodelauth\npool\nprgate\nprwatch\nreaper\nredact\nrepopath\nreviewer\nreviewfix\nroles\nscanner\nservecmd\nsetupcmd\nsnapshot\nstate\ntarball\ntriage\nui\nversioncheck\nworker\nwtlock\n\ninternal/effects:\narchtest\ndryrun.go\neffects.go\neffects_test.go\nledger.go\nlive.go\nopen.go\n\ninternal/servecmd:\nadopt.go\nadopt_test.go\nbudget.go\nbudget_test.go\ncfgloader.go\ncfgloader_test.go\nclone.go\nclone_test.go\ncommitters.go\ndigest.go\nisolation_test.go\njanitor.go\nk8s_test.go\nlimits_test.go\nloops_test.go\nmerger.go\nobserve.go\nobserve_test.go\nprwatch.go\nreaping.go\nreaping_test.go\nrebuild.go\nrebuild_test.go\nreviewer.go\nreviewer_e2e_test.go\nreviewfix.go\nreviewfix_e2e_test.go\nscanners.go\nscanners_test.go\nserve.go\nserve_test.go\nsnapshot.go\ntriage.go\ntriage_e2e_test.go\ntriage_test.go\ntty.go\nui.go\nuilog.go\nuilog_test.go\nwake.go\nwake_other.go\nwake_test.go\nwake_unix.go\nwake_unix_test.go\nworker.go\nworker_e2e_test.go\n\ninternal/ui:\nkeys.go\nmodel.go\nsanitize.go\ntestdata\nui_test.go\nview.go\na14b866 feat: Kubernetes executor, part 9: agent and pod images (#320) (#430)\nb87439e chart: k8s executor jobs namespace, network policies, RBAC, ReadWriteOncePod (#319) (#429)\nf4502fa ard(triage:lead): #416 Slice 4 of the serve command center adds an approve key to the terminal… [skip ci]\nd739403 ard(triage:engineer): #415 Adds a pause toggle and slot override keys to the serve command center,… [skip ci]\n187f007 ard(triage:lead): #415 Slice 3 of the serve command center adds the paus